The {{Term/Store|Ventest Clothing Boutique||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Armor Shop]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Sign"/><ref name="TotK Sign"/>

==Features and Overview==
==={{BotW|-}}===
The Ventest Clothing Boutique is an [[Armor Shop]] located in [[Hateno Village]].<ref name="BotW Sophie"/> It is managed by [[Sophie]], a girl who stands quietly in the corner of the store.<ref name="BotW Sophie 2"/> The Boutique notably sells two complete [[Armor Set]]s: the [[Hylian Armor Series]] and the [[Soldier's Set]]. It also features a side room, which functions as a joint kitchen and bedroom.

The Ventest Clothing Boutique was formerly operated by Sophie's father, [[Seldon]], but he has decided to give more responsibility to his daughter.<ref name="BotW Seldon"/> While giving Link a tour of Hateno Village, the Boutique will be his final stop, and he invites Link to come shopping.<ref name="BotW Seldon 2"/> If it is [[Rain]]ing outside, Seldon will run inside and sit at the work station located at the back of the store.

When Link makes a purchase from the Ventest Clothing Boutique, Sophie will thank him for doing so.<ref name="BotW Sophie 3"/><ref name="BotW Sophie 4"/><ref name="BotW Sophie 4">{{Cite|Thank you very much!|Sophie|BotW}}</ref>

