The Ventest Clothing Boutique reappears in {{TotK}}. Several giant [[Mushroom]]s have sprouted up along its edges, and the large shirt displayed above the door has been replaced to feature Mushroom patterns.

[[Sophie]]'s sister [[Cece]] has taken over the shop and turned it into an exhibition for her brand.<ref name="TotK Sophie"/> The only item on display is the [[Cece Hat]], and it is not up for sale.<ref name="TotK Cece"/> The armor pieces that should be in stock have been put away to make room for the exhibit.<ref name="TotK Sophie 2"/><ref name="TotK Cece 2"/> They are stored in the personnel-only room to the side.<ref name="TotK Game Screen"/> The door is locked, but they can be seen from the main room through an opening in the wall.

Once Link has completed "[[The Mayoral Election]]" [[Side Quest]] however, Cece agrees to put the old stock back in the main room. Link can buy the armor pieces on display from Sophie, while Cece offers [[Cece#Wares and Pricing|her own selection of wares]].<ref name="TotK Cece 3"/>

