==Trivia==
* The [[Sign]] outside of the Ventest Clothing Boutique bears [[Hylian (Language)|Hylian]] typography translating to "Tailor".<ref>{{Cite|{{Script|Hylian BotW|Tailor}}|Sign|BotW}}</ref>

==Nomenclature==
Like the other [[Shop]]s in [[Hateno Village]], the Ventest Clothing Boutique is thematically named after [[Wind]]. "Ventest" is potentially a portmanteau of ''vent'' and ''est'', French for "wind" and "east".
